window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From USA Today best-selling author Willow Winters comes a tempting tale of fated love, lust-filled secrets, and the beginnings of an epic war. </b></p> <p>Never in my life could I have prepared for what fate had in store for me. Or for any of us.</p> <p>Our tales are intertwined, and destiny saw fit to give me to a beast of a man who would die for me. He longs for me, and I for him, but my past is riddled with a darkness, and our present with deception and the whispers of war.</p> <p>Everything warns me that my life will change forever. That the world will crumble and burn. I don’t know what will happen or what will become of us. All I know is that, in his eyes, I belong to him.</p> <p>This is book three of the To Be Claimed Saga. <i>Wounded Kiss</i> is book one and should be read first.</p>"; 
